sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FX as Hilo JavaFX
    participant MAIN as Hilo realtime
    participant CAP as Hilo captura
    participant IN as AudioInput
    participant BUF as AdaptivePcmBuffer
    participant OUT as AudioOutput

    FX->>MAIN: stop()
    FX->>FX: estado → STOPPING
    FX->>IN: stop() + close()
    FX->>OUT: flush() + stop() + close()
    FX->>MAIN: interrupt()
    FX->>CAP: interrupt()

    par Desbloqueo de captura
        IN--xCAP: read() termina / lanza
        CAP->>BUF: close()
    and Desbloqueo de reproducción
        BUF--xMAIN: await/read termina
        OUT--xMAIN: write() termina
    end

    MAIN->>BUF: close()
    MAIN->>IN: safeStop()
    MAIN->>CAP: interrupt()
    MAIN->>CAP: join(hasta 1 s)
    MAIN->>MAIN: limpia referencias activas
    MAIN-->>FX: publica STOPPED

    Note over FX,OUT: stopRequested es volatile y el cierre es idempotente
